  "texts": {
    "preamble": "B.Thukkaram vs The Secretary To Government on 4 January, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.35489 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated :04.01.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.35489 of 2023 B.Thukkaram ..... Petitioner Vs 1. The Secretary to Government, Home Department, Secretariat, Chennai. 2. Director General of Police, Mylapore, Chennai. 3. Deputy Inspector General of Police, Kanchipuram Range, Kanchipuram. 4. District Superintendent of Police, Collectorate Campus, Kanchipuram. 5. District Superintendent of Police, Q-Branch C.I.D Mylapore , Chennai. ..... Respondents Prayer:- Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of I for the issuance of Writ of Mandamus, directing the respondents to consider the representation of petitioner dated 03.11.2023 and consequently directing the respondents to pay additional charge allowance for working as additional charge food safety officer to Sriperumbudur Block from 10.01.2022 to till date. Page 1 of 4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.3 For Petitioner : Mr.U.Jugal Kumar For Respondents : Dr.T.Seenivasan Special Government Pleader B.Thukkaram vs The Secretary To Government on 4 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41855294/ 1 ORDER",
